  "term": "VT",
  "definition": "VT refers to vision training, a set of repeated activities designed to strengthen visual abilities such as eye movements, visual attention, and visuospatial processing. In psychology-related use, it aims to improve how visual information is processed and how quickly and effectively attention can be directed or shifted.",
